sequenceDiagram
    participant Runtime as Caikit Serving Runtime<br/>(caikit-tgis-serving)
    participant Backend as TGISBackend<br/>(in-process)
    participant Conn as TGISConnection<br/>(gRPC channel)
    participant LB as GRPCLoadBalancerProxy<br/>(DNS polling)
    participant TGIS_R as TGIS Server (Remote)<br/>configurable port / gRPC
    participant TGIS_L as TGIS Subprocess (Local)<br/>50055/TCP gRPC
    participant Health as TGIS Health Endpoint<br/>3000/TCP HTTP
    participant DNS as DNS Resolver<br/>53/UDP

    Note over Runtime,TGIS_R: Flow 1: Remote TGIS Inference
    Runtime->>Backend: get_client(model_id)
    Backend->>Conn: lookup/create connection
    Conn->>TGIS_R: gRPC Generate/GenerateStream<br/>TLS 1.2+ / mTLS<br/>CA cert + client cert
    TGIS_R-->>Conn: Inference response<br/>TLS 1.2+ / mTLS
    Conn-->>Runtime: GeneratedTextResult

    Note over Runtime,Health: Flow 2: Local TGIS Subprocess Inference
    Runtime->>Backend: start(model_id, model_path)
    Backend->>TGIS_L: ManagedTGISSubprocess.launch()<br/>OS subprocess
    loop Health polling
        Backend->>Health: GET /health<br/>3000/TCP HTTP plaintext
        Health-->>Backend: 200 OK
    end
    Runtime->>Backend: get_client(model_id)
    Backend->>TGIS_L: gRPC Generate<br/>50055/TCP plaintext
    TGIS_L-->>Backend: Inference response
    Backend-->>Runtime: GeneratedTextResult

    Note over LB,DNS: Flow 3: DNS-Based Load Balancing
    loop Every 10s (configurable)
        LB->>DNS: socket.getaddrinfo(hostname)<br/>53/UDP plaintext
        DNS-->>LB: IP addresses
        alt New endpoints detected
            LB->>TGIS_R: Reconnect gRPC channel<br/>TLS/mTLS
        end
    end
